  noteContent: I put a cat in a box with a radioactive atom and poison. In 30 minutes,
    the atom may or may not have decayed. The decay is quantum random, so until I
    open the box, the atom is both decayed and intact. Therefore, the cat is both
    dead and alive at the same time.
